From: Slashy <amirramy.chatbi@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 15:02:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 05/11] feat(p01): pace the free pool so a fast-looping agent
 cannot burn a day of quota in an hour

paceMs makes the pool wait between calls instead of failing; maxCallsPerDay is a
hard pool-wide ceiling. Both persist in KV, so a restart keeps the day's count.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NptGK4Xppd57AQrT6DuM24
